---
// Realtime Risk Engine Shadow Pipeline Evaluation Diagram Component
---

<figure class="rsp-diag" aria-labelledby="rsp-diag-caption">
  <!-- Desktop SVG Layout -->
  <svg
    class="rsp-diag__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 880 340"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="rsp-diag-title rsp-diag-desc"
  >
    <title id="rsp-diag-title">
      風控模型影子模式（Shadow Pipeline）雙軌驗收架構圖
    </title>
    <desc id="rsp-diag-desc">
      展示生產即時請求鏡像分流，線上模型 v1 實際執行阻斷與扣款，影子模型 v2
      僅非同步評分打日誌並由離線自動比對準確率與召回率。
    </desc>

    <defs>
      <marker
        id="rsp-arrow-green"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="rsp-diag__arrow-head--green"
        ></path>
      </marker>
      <marker
        id="rsp-arrow-purple"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="rsp-diag__arrow-head--purple"
        ></path>
      </marker>
      <marker
        id="rsp-arrow-blue"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="rsp-diag__arrow-head--blue"
        ></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <!-- Outer Card Background -->
    <rect
      x="25"
      y="15"
      width="830"
      height="310"
      rx="12"
      class="rsp-diag__card-bg"></rect>

    <!-- Top Ingress: Live Request (x: 270, width: 340) -->
    <g transform="translate(270, 30)">
      <rect
        width="340"
        height="42"
        rx="8"
        class="rsp-diag__box rsp-diag__box--blue"></rect>
      <text
        x="170"
        y="26"
        class="rsp-diag__title rsp-diag__title--blue"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        生產即時交易請求 (Live Production Request)
      </text>
    </g>

    <!-- Split Arrows: Live path vs Shadow mirror path -->
    <path
      d="M 370 72 L 220 115"
      class="rsp-diag__path rsp-diag__path--green"
      marker-end="url(#rsp-arrow-green)"></path>
    <text x="260" y="90" class="rsp-diag__tag-text rsp-diag__tag-text--green"
      >線上主鏈路 (100%)</text
    >

    <path
      d="M 510 72 L 660 115"
      class="rsp-diag__path rsp-diag__path--purple rsp-diag__path--dashed"
      marker-end="url(#rsp-arrow-purple)"></path>
    <text x="610" y="90" class="rsp-diag__tag-text rsp-diag__tag-text--purple"
      >非同步鏡像 (Mirror)</text
    >

    <!-- Left Box: Production Model v1 (x: 50, y: 120, width: 355) -->
    <g transform="translate(50, 120)">
      <rect
        width="355"
        height="95"
        rx="8"
        class="rsp-diag__box rsp-diag__box--green"></rect>
      <text
        x="177"
        y="26"
        class="rsp-diag__title rsp-diag__title--green"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        生產在線風控模型 (Model v1 - Active)
      </text>
      <text x="177" y="52" class="rsp-diag__sub-text" text-anchor="middle">
        • 實際判定決策：放行 / 阻斷 / 挑戰
      </text>
      <rect
        x="50"
        y="65"
        width="255"
        height="22"
        rx="4"
        class="rsp-diag__pill rsp-diag__pill--green"></rect>
      <text
        x="177"
        y="80"
        class="rsp-diag__pill-text rsp-diag__pill-text--green"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        ➔ 決定線上真實扣款，零防護真空
      </text>
    </g>

    <!-- Right Box: Shadow Model v2 (x: 475, y: 120, width: 355) -->
    <g transform="translate(475, 120)">
      <rect
        width="355"
        height="95"
        rx="8"
        class="rsp-diag__box rsp-diag__box--purple"></rect>
      <text
        x="177"
        y="26"
        class="rsp-diag__title rsp-diag__title--purple"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        實驗中新模型 (Model v2 - Shadow Mode)
      </text>
      <text x="177" y="52" class="rsp-diag__sub-text" text-anchor="middle">
        • 僅在背景評分打標、記錄推論日誌
      </text>
      <rect
        x="50"
        y="65"
        width="255"
        height="22"
        rx="4"
        class="rsp-diag__pill rsp-diag__pill--purple"></rect>
      <text
        x="177"
        y="80"
        class="rsp-diag__pill-text rsp-diag__pill-text--purple"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        ➔ 決策結果絕不阻斷，零業務誤傷風險
      </text>
    </g>

    <!-- Converging Arrows to Offline Evaluation -->
    <path
      d="M 227 215 L 370 252"
      class="rsp-diag__path rsp-diag__path--blue"
      marker-end="url(#rsp-arrow-blue)"></path>
    <path
      d="M 652 215 L 510 252"
      class="rsp-diag__path rsp-diag__path--blue"
      marker-end="url(#rsp-arrow-blue)"></path>

    <!-- Bottom Box: Offline Evaluation (x: 180, y: 255, width: 520) -->
    <g transform="translate(180, 255)">
      <rect
        width="520"
        height="50"
        rx="8"
        class="rsp-diag__box rsp-diag__box--blue"></rect>
      <text
        x="260"
        y="24"
        class="rsp-diag__title rsp-diag__title--blue"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        離線準確率 / 召回率 / 混淆矩陣自動回歸比對
      </text>
      <text x="260" y="40" class="rsp-diag__sub-text" text-anchor="middle">
        比對 v1 與 v2 決策差異 ➔ 驗證 Precision/Recall 滿意 ➔ 平滑灰度切換線上
      </text>
    </g>
  </svg>

  <!-- Mobile View (Vertical Cards) -->
  <div class="rsp-diag__mobile">
    <div class="rsp-diag__mobile-card rsp-diag__mobile-card--blue">
      <span class="rsp-diag__mobile-badge rsp-diag__mobile-badge--blue"
        >TRAFFIC INGRESS</span
      >
      <h4>1. 生產流量分發</h4>
      <p>即時支付請求到達，網關同時觸發同步在線鏈路與非同步鏡像鏈路。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="rsp-diag__mobile-card rsp-diag__mobile-card--green">
      <span class="rsp-diag__mobile-badge rsp-diag__mobile-badge--green"
        >ACTIVE MODEL</span
      >
      <h4>2. 線上生產模型 (v1)</h4>
      <p>
        擁有唯一真實決策權：執行放行、阻斷或挑戰，確保交易即時處理並保護業務資產。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="rsp-diag__mobile-card rsp-diag__mobile-card--purple">
      <span class="rsp-diag__mobile-badge rsp-diag__mobile-badge--purple"
        >SHADOW EVALUATION</span
      >
      <h4>3. 影子模型 (v2)</h4>
      <p>
        接收真實鏡像流量進行推論並記錄日誌，其決策結果絕不干預實際扣款，達成零業務誤傷風險。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="rsp-diag__mobile-card rsp-diag__mobile-card--blue">
      <span class="rsp-diag__mobile-badge rsp-diag__mobile-badge--blue"
        >AUTOMATED AUDIT</span
      >
      <h4>4. 離線自動化混淆矩陣比對</h4>
      <p>
        離線數據平台自動比對 v1 與 v2 決策差異，檢視 Precision 與 Recall
        指標，達標後方可進入線上灰度權重調升。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption id="rsp-diag-caption" class="rsp-diag__caption">
    圖二：風控模型影子模式（Shadow Pipeline）雙軌驗收與離線指標比對架構
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .rsp-diag {
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .rsp-diag__desktop {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .rsp-diag__mobile {
    display: none;
  }

  .rsp-diag__caption {
    margin-top: 0.875rem;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--dg-muted, #8b949e);
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  /* SVG Theme Token Styles */
  .rsp-diag__card-bg {
    fill: var(--dg-surface, #161b22);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule, #30363d);
    stroke-width: 1.5px;
  }

  .rsp-diag__box {
    stroke-width: 1.5px;
  }

  .rsp-diag__box--blue {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2, #1f242c);
    stroke: #388bfd;
  }

  .rsp-diag__box--green {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2, #1b2e23);
    stroke: #238636;
  }

  .rsp-diag__box--purple {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2, #241b35);
    stroke: #bc8cff;
  }

  .rsp-diag__title {
    font-family:
      system-ui,
      -apple-system,
      sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .rsp-diag__title--blue {
    fill: #58a6ff;
  }

  .rsp-diag__title--green {
    fill: #3fb950;
  }

  .rsp-diag__title--purple {
    fill: #d2a8ff;
  }

  .rsp-diag__sub-text {
    font-family:
      system-ui,
      -apple-system,
      sans-serif;
    font-size: 11px;
    fill: var(--dg-ink-2, #8b949e);
  }

  .rsp-diag__tag-text {
    font-family:
      system-ui,
      -apple-system,
      sans-serif;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .rsp-diag__tag-text--green {
    fill: #3fb950;
  }

  .rsp-diag__tag-text--purple {
    fill: #d2a8ff;
  }

  .rsp-diag__pill {
    stroke-width: 1px;
  }

  .rsp-diag__pill--green {
    fill: rgba(35, 134, 54, 0.2);
    stroke: #238636;
  }

  .rsp-diag__pill--purple {
    fill: rgba(188, 140, 255, 0.15);
    stroke: #bc8cff;
  }

  .rsp-diag__pill-text {
    font-family:
      system-ui,
      -apple-system,
      sans-serif;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .rsp-diag__pill-text--green {
    fill: #56d364;
  }

  .rsp-diag__pill-text--purple {
    fill: #d2a8ff;
  }

  .rsp-diag__path {
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 2px;
  }

  .rsp-diag__path--blue {
    stroke: #388bfd;
  }

  .rsp-diag__path--green {
    stroke: #238636;
  }

  .rsp-diag__path--purple {
    stroke: #bc8cff;
  }

  .rsp-diag__path--dashed {
    stroke-dasharray: 4 3;
  }

  .rsp-diag__arrow-head--blue {
    fill: #388bfd;
  }

  .rsp-diag__arrow-head--green {
    fill: #238636;
  }

  .rsp-diag__arrow-head--purple {
    fill: #bc8cff;
  }

  /* Light Theme Adjustments */
  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .rsp-diag__card-bg {
    fill: var(--dg-surface, #ffffff);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule, #d0d7de);
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .rsp-diag__box--blue {
    fill: #eff7ff;
    stroke: #0969da;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .rsp-diag__box--green {
    fill: #dafbe1;
    stroke: #1a7f37;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .rsp-diag__box--purple {
    fill: #fbefff;
    stroke: #8250df;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .rsp-diag__title--blue {
    fill: #0969da;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .rsp-diag__title--green {
    fill: #1a7f37;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .rsp-diag__title--purple {
    fill: #8250df;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .rsp-diag__tag-text--green {
    fill: #1a7f37;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .rsp-diag__tag-text--purple {
    fill: #8250df;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .rsp-diag__pill--green {
    fill: #dcfce7;
    stroke: #1a7f37;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .rsp-diag__pill--purple {
    fill: #f3e8ff;
    stroke: #8250df;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .rsp-diag__pill-text--green {
    fill: #1a7f37;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .rsp-diag__pill-text--purple {
    fill: #8250df;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .rsp-diag__path--blue {
    stroke: #0969da;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .rsp-diag__path--green {
    stroke: #1a7f37;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .rsp-diag__path--purple {
    stroke: #8250df;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .rsp-diag__arrow-head--blue {
    fill: #0969da;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .rsp-diag__arrow-head--green {
    fill: #1a7f37;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .rsp-diag__arrow-head--purple {
    fill: #8250df;
  }

  /* Mobile Responsive View */
  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .rsp-diag__desktop {
      display: none !important;
    }

    .rsp-diag__mobile {
      display: flex !important;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.875rem;
    }

    .rsp-diag__mobile-card {
      padding: 1rem 1.125rem;
      border-radius: 0.5rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--dg-rule, #30363d);
      background: var(--dg-surface, #161b22);
    }

    .rsp-diag__mobile-card--blue {
      border-color: #388bfd;
      background: rgba(56, 139, 253, 0.05);
    }

    .rsp-diag__mobile-card--green {
      border-color: #238636;
      background: rgba(35, 134, 54, 0.05);
    }

    .rsp-diag__mobile-card--purple {
      border-color: #bc8cff;
      background: rgba(188, 140, 255, 0.05);
    }

    .rsp-diag__mobile-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.125rem 0.4rem;
      border-radius: 0.25rem;
      font-size: 0.6875rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      margin-bottom: 0.375rem;
    }

    .rsp-diag__mobile-badge--blue {
      background: rgba(56, 139, 253, 0.2);
      color: #58a6ff;
    }

    .rsp-diag__mobile-badge--green {
      background: rgba(35, 134, 54, 0.2);
      color: #3fb950;
    }

    .rsp-diag__mobile-badge--purple {
      background: rgba(188, 140, 255, 0.2);
      color: #d2a8ff;
    }

    .rsp-diag__mobile-card h4 {
      margin: 0 0 0.375rem;
      font-size: 0.9375rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--dg-ink, #f0f6fc);
    }

    .rsp-diag__mobile-card p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: var(--dg-ink-2, #8b949e);
    }
  }
</style>
